WEBVTT

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:06.174
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:00:06.424 --> 00:00:09.010
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:11.888
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:00:12.138 --> 00:00:13.389
(Get ready!)

00:00:14.182 --> 00:00:18.645
Coming down,
could you fill your satisfaction?

00:00:19.854 --> 00:00:24.150
You're a MOB.
Can't you feel your own frustration?

00:00:25.527 --> 00:00:29.906
Coming down,
could you fill your satisfaction?

00:00:31.241 --> 00:00:34.035
You're a MOB.
What do you want to be?

00:00:34.285 --> 00:00:41.000
Wear your overflowing emotions
on your sleeve and break it down

00:00:42.835 --> 00:00:46.130
What do you see once you go
beyond your limits?

00:00:46.381 --> 00:00:49.050
(99.9! 99.9)

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.220
The mysterious percentage

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:56.391
Cr yin' my life, or yin' my psyche,

00:00:56.641 --> 00:00:59.394
Cr yin' my heart in such commonplaces!

00:00:59.644 --> 00:01:02.230
Is that your ideal? Is that your mind?

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:05.066
It all begins when it hits 100

00:01:05.316 --> 00:01:07.902
The MOB is alive. The MOB is high.

00:01:08.152 --> 00:01:10.780
The MOB is staying frustrated, aren't you?

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:15.118
Is that your ideal?
Is that your mind? Right now

00:01:16.578 --> 00:01:17.704
YOUR LIFE IS YOUR OWN.

00:01:17.954 --> 00:01:20.290
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:20.415
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:01:20.415 --> 00:01:20.665
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:01:20.665 --> 00:01:23.251
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, dig your anger up, MOB!)

00:01:23.251 --> 00:01:23.501
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:01:23.501 --> 00:01:24.836
"Mob Psycho 100 II"
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:01:24.836 --> 00:01:26.170
(Get ready, wake your psyche up, MOB!)

00:01:26.421 --> 00:01:27.672
(Get ready!)

00:01:30.008 --> 00:01:33.970
"Boss Fight
- The Final Light~"

00:01:36.973 --> 00:01:39.559
Now I'll be able to hit
you with everything...

00:01:39.809 --> 00:01:43.062
My powers... and my rage.

00:01:51.195 --> 00:01:52.614
"Output 20%"

00:01:57.493 --> 00:01:58.828
Is that it?

00:02:04.459 --> 00:02:06.794
This is finally getting interesting.

00:02:19.849 --> 00:02:21.517
You're...

00:02:21.768 --> 00:02:24.228
You're enjoying this, too, aren't you?

00:02:27.523 --> 00:02:29.692
What the hell is going on?

00:02:29.942 --> 00:02:32.028
They're fighting in
a whole different stratosphere!

00:02:35.865 --> 00:02:40.536
As righteous as you try to sound,
deep down, you're the same as me.

00:02:44.666 --> 00:02:46.209
Nii-san!

00:02:46.459 --> 00:02:48.586
How does it feel to be released
from your shackles?

00:02:48.836 --> 00:02:51.673
We are freer than anyone else!

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:55.718
Nii-san...

00:03:12.902 --> 00:03:15.988
How... How could I...

00:03:16.239 --> 00:03:17.824
How could I be so foolish?

00:03:18.866 --> 00:03:23.454
It may have only been for a moment,
but I let this power control me!

00:03:26.332 --> 00:03:28.251
You're so emotionally unstable.

00:03:28.501 --> 00:03:33.506
At this rate, you'll never catch up to me,
no matter how far you go.

00:03:33.756 --> 00:03:35.842
I am the best in the world!

00:03:36.884 --> 00:03:41.639
How did your life end up being so hollow?

00:03:42.682 --> 00:03:46.602
I can't judge you for the life
you chose, though.

00:03:46.853 --> 00:03:48.938
You were just unlucky.

00:03:50.356 --> 00:03:51.691
What are you talking about?

00:03:51.941 --> 00:03:56.112
There is no one in this world
that is as lucky as me!

00:03:56.362 --> 00:03:57.780
"Output 50%"

00:03:58.364 --> 00:04:00.283
Heaven bestowed these powers upon me

00:04:00.533 --> 00:04:05.955
and made you all extras,
created solely to make my star shine!

00:04:06.205 --> 00:04:10.501
Really? Then it wasn't luck
that you were lacking.

00:04:10.752 --> 00:04:12.253
It was bonds.

00:04:12.503 --> 00:04:13.880
What?

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:17.967
You were the only one
who existed in your world.

00:04:18.217 --> 00:04:20.470
You lived in overwhelming solitude.

00:04:21.846 --> 00:04:23.264
I know that feeling well...

00:04:23.514 --> 00:04:26.642
Living in a world where I'm completely alone,
one I want to forget forever.

00:04:28.853 --> 00:04:30.354
I don't understand.

00:04:30.605 --> 00:04:31.397
Why?

00:04:31.647 --> 00:04:33.733
Why are you crying?

00:04:35.526 --> 00:04:38.362
You might not believe me,

00:04:38.613 --> 00:04:41.991
but I really don't want to hurt you.

00:05:04.555 --> 00:05:05.640
I'm sorry...

00:05:12.897 --> 00:05:14.857
What the hell is going on?

00:05:15.107 --> 00:05:16.776
Don't ask me.

00:05:17.026 --> 00:05:19.570
The president's aura is gone.

00:05:19.821 --> 00:05:22.698
Does that mean it's over?

00:05:22.949 --> 00:05:23.991
Yes!

00:05:24.242 --> 00:05:27.286
Impressive. Is that boy actually human?

00:05:27.537 --> 00:05:30.039
He's just a normal middle school kid.

00:05:30.289 --> 00:05:34.669
Nii-san... You used a tremendous
amount of power again.

00:05:34.919 --> 00:05:36.546
It's not over yet.

00:05:36.796 --> 00:05:39.549
My dad's aura didn't disappear.

00:05:39.799 --> 00:05:41.050
It changed.

00:05:43.845 --> 00:05:47.849
My dad mentioned before that
he picked up the habit of only awakening

00:05:48.099 --> 00:05:49.976
when put under a lot of stress.

00:06:22.133 --> 00:06:24.010
This goes beyond human understanding.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:27.722
How can one man's powers be so immense?

00:06:27.972 --> 00:06:32.310
Shigeo... This is the one day in your life
you shouldn't try to do the impossible.

00:06:32.560 --> 00:06:37.106
He's already using way more power
than he did when he beat me.

00:06:37.356 --> 00:06:39.358
If you can't win, run.

00:06:39.609 --> 00:06:43.112
You're not responsible for any of this,

00:06:43.362 --> 00:06:44.614
Mob.

00:06:46.991 --> 00:06:49.327
I've never felt like this before.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:51.829
Wake up.

00:06:52.079 --> 00:06:55.374
Don't think I'm going to let you say
you're done already.

00:06:57.126 --> 00:06:58.794
Wake up!

00:06:59.045 --> 00:07:00.796
No.

00:07:01.047 --> 00:07:02.340
As much as I hate to admit it,

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:04.675
I'm not strong enough.

00:07:04.926 --> 00:07:09.305
I don't have the power
to show you a new path.

00:07:11.015 --> 00:07:15.895
You awakened my destructive impulses,
now you have to deal with them!

00:07:16.145 --> 00:07:19.148
Don't go hiding in your shell now!

00:07:26.405 --> 00:07:28.074
I give up.

00:07:28.324 --> 00:07:33.079
I hoped that you could turn over a new leaf
and become a better person...

00:07:33.329 --> 00:07:34.705
...but that hope's gone now!

00:07:39.502 --> 00:07:42.421
I-It appears... that we're both...

00:07:42.672 --> 00:07:47.218
...influencing each other quite a bit...

00:07:47.468 --> 00:07:51.722
Yes. But I couldn't be a good influence.

00:07:51.973 --> 00:07:54.517
I'm done. We can both lose at this point.

00:07:58.187 --> 00:07:59.563
"Output 100%"

00:07:59.647 --> 00:08:00.898
This is...

00:08:05.820 --> 00:08:07.446
I might actually die...

00:08:08.322 --> 00:08:09.323
Mob!

00:08:12.243 --> 00:08:13.119
Shigeo.

00:08:13.369 --> 00:08:14.787
--Nii-san!
--Heya.

00:08:15.037 --> 00:08:16.288
Well done.

00:08:17.289 --> 00:08:19.291
No, this is nothing.

00:08:19.542 --> 00:08:21.627
Nothing compared to the fear
of losing all I have.

00:08:38.853 --> 00:08:43.024
Body improvement! Fight on!

00:09:12.094 --> 00:09:13.262
I'll defeat you!

00:09:22.688 --> 00:09:24.857
If something like that makes it outside...

00:09:27.443 --> 00:09:28.819
It'll explode...

00:09:32.364 --> 00:09:33.866
It'll explode?

00:09:34.116 --> 00:09:36.285
Oh, it'll explode!

00:09:37.661 --> 00:09:40.831
Run away! Everyone, run away!

00:09:41.082 --> 00:09:43.459
--Mob!
--You're alive!

00:09:43.709 --> 00:09:46.587
He ended up releasing too much
energy and self-destructed!

00:09:46.837 --> 00:09:48.172
You're bleeding like crazy!

00:09:48.422 --> 00:09:50.966
Master, please run!

00:09:51.217 --> 00:09:53.260
All that's left is an
excessive amount of energy.

00:09:53.511 --> 00:09:56.013
I'm pretty sure an explosion will happen,

00:09:56.263 --> 00:09:58.265
a huge one at that!

00:09:59.767 --> 00:10:01.811
So you're saying we won't
be able to contain it.

00:10:02.061 --> 00:10:03.062
Let's hurry!

00:10:05.689 --> 00:10:06.607
Ritsu.

00:10:06.857 --> 00:10:09.735
Let's run. We're gonna get caught
up in that if we stay here.

00:10:11.112 --> 00:10:13.531
That's the president's final light...

00:10:13.781 --> 00:10:16.075
Our president who was trying
to take over the world...

00:10:16.325 --> 00:10:18.786
Just shut up and run! You're gonna die!

00:10:19.036 --> 00:10:21.664
Huh? Hey, where's Shigeo?

00:10:24.083 --> 00:10:26.127
You made the right choice.

00:10:26.377 --> 00:10:27.711
There's no way to avoid this.

00:10:27.962 --> 00:10:31.132
Your only choice is to end my life--
to sever the energy source--

00:10:31.382 --> 00:10:33.884
Before the explosion happens.

00:10:35.886 --> 00:10:36.887
What are you doing?

00:10:37.138 --> 00:10:38.889
I'm going to contain the explosion.

00:10:39.974 --> 00:10:42.601
In the end, you aren't able to defeat me,

00:10:42.852 --> 00:10:47.565
save your friends, or save yourself.

00:10:47.815 --> 00:10:51.527
With your powers, you should've
been able to handle this better.

00:10:51.777 --> 00:10:55.072
Just having powers doesn't mean
everything works out for you.

00:10:55.322 --> 00:10:57.825
But that's perfectly fine...

00:10:58.909 --> 00:11:03.038
...as long as you make
the important choices yourself.

00:11:03.289 --> 00:11:06.417
I'm the protagonist of my own life.

00:11:08.294 --> 00:11:10.713
That's why I chose to be here.

00:11:10.963 --> 00:11:15.176
No matter how much I dislike you,
to leave you to suffer on your own

00:11:15.426 --> 00:11:17.970
would just be too sad.

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:20.598
So I'm going to help you.

00:11:23.267 --> 00:11:26.437
What do you plan to do with that filthy cat?

00:11:26.687 --> 00:11:30.733
Well, the poor thing was drenched
and shivering in the rain.

00:11:30.983 --> 00:11:32.401
And think about it...

00:11:32.651 --> 00:11:35.404
Sho will grow up into a gentle boy.

00:11:35.654 --> 00:11:38.073
He's going to grow up watching you, after all.

00:11:38.324 --> 00:11:41.577
We need to be gentle. Gentle.

00:11:41.827 --> 00:11:44.330
Why did you have to be so violent?!

00:11:44.580 --> 00:11:49.793
To lead an organization,
I need to establish my dominance.

00:11:50.044 --> 00:11:52.504
You can't move people's hearts
with psychic powers!

00:11:52.755 --> 00:11:55.341
No, power is absolute.

00:11:55.591 --> 00:11:59.345
As long as I have this power,
people will follow me.

00:11:59.595 --> 00:12:01.889
You think that's true for everyone?

00:12:02.139 --> 00:12:03.098
I do.

00:12:03.349 --> 00:12:06.227
Sho is also showing interest
in my powers as well.

00:12:06.477 --> 00:12:07.937
Goodbye.

00:12:13.108 --> 00:12:15.319
When did I...

00:12:20.199 --> 00:12:21.700
If I can absorb it...

00:12:21.951 --> 00:12:24.370
Don't. You'll just end up...

00:12:27.831 --> 00:12:30.251
You wanted to apologize, didn't you?!

00:12:30.501 --> 00:12:34.255
Then you need to say it loud and clear!

00:12:37.883 --> 00:12:41.553
That's right. I also...

00:12:41.804 --> 00:12:46.058
I also have someone I need
to express my feelings to!

00:13:08.914 --> 00:13:10.040
Mob...

00:13:14.086 --> 00:13:14.920
"Mob Psycho 100 II"

00:13:20.384 --> 00:13:21.260
Nii-san!

00:13:21.510 --> 00:13:23.262
Hey, wake up!

00:13:23.512 --> 00:13:24.638
Kageyama-kun!

00:13:24.888 --> 00:13:26.598
--Mob!
--Shigeo!

00:13:26.849 --> 00:13:28.183
Nii-san!

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:31.103
He's regained consciousness.

00:13:31.353 --> 00:13:32.604
Let's dig him out.

00:13:36.317 --> 00:13:37.818
Thank goodness you're okay.

00:13:38.068 --> 00:13:40.112
Unbelievable.

00:13:40.362 --> 00:13:43.407
Anyway, we should get away from here.

00:13:43.657 --> 00:13:44.783
Can you walk?

00:13:45.034 --> 00:13:46.035
Yes...

00:13:46.285 --> 00:13:50.456
All of our wounds have been healed.
Our clothes are in shambles, though.

00:13:50.706 --> 00:13:51.790
You're right...

00:13:52.041 --> 00:13:54.835
Shigeo, what's up with
the left side of your chest?

00:13:55.919 --> 00:13:58.589
That's quite the bold fashion statement.

00:13:58.839 --> 00:14:02.551
Seriously... You never cease to amaze.

00:14:02.801 --> 00:14:04.803
I do consider you my rival, you know?

00:14:05.054 --> 00:14:07.431
Don't wander off too far.

00:14:13.937 --> 00:14:16.899
This ground... It's not concrete.

00:14:17.149 --> 00:14:19.401
My mind feels all spacey.

00:14:19.651 --> 00:14:21.445
The sky seems cramped.

00:14:21.695 --> 00:14:23.864
Where are we?

00:14:24.114 --> 00:14:26.825
There's the exit. Watch out for
things that may fall onto your head.

00:14:27.868 --> 00:14:29.036
It's quiet.

00:14:29.286 --> 00:14:31.955
Surprisingly, there aren't any
news helicopters flying around.

00:14:32.206 --> 00:14:33.415
Well, yeah.

00:14:33.665 --> 00:14:36.710
They're too scared to come here
when they know so little.

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:38.796
Everything seems fine,
even after that giant explosion.

00:14:39.046 --> 00:14:40.589
What's going on?

00:14:40.839 --> 00:14:44.343
I seriously thought
you were a goner back there.

00:14:45.427 --> 00:14:48.847
I was sure ground zero
would've been eviscerated.

00:14:50.724 --> 00:14:52.184
The hell is that?

00:14:53.227 --> 00:14:55.938
But what appeared there happened to be...

00:14:56.188 --> 00:14:57.272
Hey!

00:14:57.523 --> 00:15:01.860
Nii-san! Are you okay?
Are you still actually hurt somewhere?

00:15:02.111 --> 00:15:05.864
Thanks, Ritsu. I think my body's okay.

00:15:06.115 --> 00:15:08.575
But lately, whenever I use a lot of power,

00:15:08.826 --> 00:15:11.078
I have a hard time staying awake afterward.

00:15:11.328 --> 00:15:12.454
Huh?

00:15:15.416 --> 00:15:17.209
I'll carry you partway,

00:15:17.459 --> 00:15:18.669
SO you can rest.

00:15:20.129 --> 00:15:23.674
Carry him where? Our house is...

00:15:23.924 --> 00:15:28.512
Sorry, he'll fix up your house,
but he'll need three days.

00:15:28.762 --> 00:15:30.639
Just three days?!

00:15:32.099 --> 00:15:33.934
You guys wanna come to my place?

00:15:34.184 --> 00:15:36.603
It'll be a bit cramped,
but I'm sure we can make it work.

00:15:37.729 --> 00:15:40.858
At least try to hide your displeasure, jeez.

00:15:41.108 --> 00:15:43.110
Oh, don't worry about me.

00:15:45.612 --> 00:15:48.282
Could we stop by the school first?

00:15:48.532 --> 00:15:49.992
At this hour?

00:15:50.242 --> 00:15:52.995
There should be a spare
tracksuit in his club room.

00:15:53.203 --> 00:15:55.372
"Telepathy Club"
"Body Improvement Club"

00:15:57.291 --> 00:15:58.417
That must be it.

00:15:59.626 --> 00:16:00.836
I wonder if I could borrow one for myself.

00:16:00.836 --> 00:16:03.046
"Lower body strengthening month!!" I
wonder if I could borrow one for myself.

00:16:03.046 --> 00:16:03.297
"Lower body
strengthening month!!"

00:16:03.297 --> 00:16:04.548
"Lower body strengthening month!!"
But I can't do it without asking...

00:16:04.548 --> 00:16:04.715
"Lower body
strengthening month!!"

00:16:04.798 --> 00:16:07.885
Tracksuit thieves!

00:16:08.135 --> 00:16:09.136
Captain.

00:16:09.386 --> 00:16:11.013
My heart just stopped!

00:16:12.431 --> 00:16:14.099
I see.

00:16:14.349 --> 00:16:18.187
I came here to get some dumbbells,
and you sure gave me a scare.

00:16:18.437 --> 00:16:21.356
Sorry... You scared us pretty good, too.

00:16:21.607 --> 00:16:22.900
I understand the situation now.

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:25.068
Hang on one second.

00:16:26.111 --> 00:16:28.947
Hello? You see...

00:16:30.574 --> 00:16:34.411
Um... Why's everyone from
the Body Improvement Club here?

00:16:34.661 --> 00:16:35.913
We're about to...

00:16:36.163 --> 00:16:37.789
The Body Improvement Club

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:42.794
will now begin a three-day four-night
strengthening hell training camp!

00:16:44.296 --> 00:16:45.255
No, we're--

00:16:45.506 --> 00:16:47.508
We should always help
each other out when in need!

00:16:47.758 --> 00:16:49.468
I mean, we're really tired--

00:16:49.718 --> 00:16:51.845
I'm sure you want to sleep on a giant futon!

00:16:52.095 --> 00:16:53.305
No, a small one will do just fine!

00:16:53.555 --> 00:16:56.266
We have enough room for all
of you at my granny's house!

00:16:56.517 --> 00:16:59.561
You have to procure and make your own food,
so it'll be excellent training!

00:16:59.811 --> 00:17:01.980
And it's just a 90-minute jog away!
We'll be there in no time!

00:17:02.231 --> 00:17:03.065
Now, let's go!

00:17:03.315 --> 00:17:04.816
R-Reigen-san, help...

00:17:05.067 --> 00:17:07.778
Hey, that's great. Do your best.

00:17:08.028 --> 00:17:09.655
I'm gonna take a cab home.

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:12.658
Body Improvement!

00:17:12.908 --> 00:17:14.493
Fight on! Fight on!

00:17:14.743 --> 00:17:16.036
How cruel...

00:17:17.329 --> 00:17:19.122
I totally forgot!

00:17:19.373 --> 00:17:22.376
I should've just gone over
to Reigen-san's place.

00:17:27.965 --> 00:17:30.300
I wonder what that thing is.

00:17:30.551 --> 00:17:33.720
It's even more confusing up close.

00:17:33.971 --> 00:17:37.099
How does one of these things even grow?

00:17:37.349 --> 00:17:39.476
Isn't it obvious?!

00:17:39.726 --> 00:17:42.980
Aliens! This is the work of aliens!

00:17:44.356 --> 00:17:46.733
--Amazing.
--Could this be...

00:17:46.984 --> 00:17:49.194
...the work of our beloved leader?

00:17:50.237 --> 00:17:52.990
Wow... It looks like a vegetable.

00:17:54.032 --> 00:17:56.326
I bet Mob-kun was involved.

00:17:56.577 --> 00:17:58.245
I just know it.

00:17:58.495 --> 00:17:59.997
That's amazing!

00:18:00.247 --> 00:18:02.499
You're the ones behind that giant plant?

00:18:02.749 --> 00:18:03.875
W-Well...

00:18:04.126 --> 00:18:07.796
If you're asking if we were
directly involved, then no.

00:18:08.046 --> 00:18:10.173
--We basically were, though.
--What?

00:18:10.424 --> 00:18:12.509
Amazing! Fantastic!

00:18:12.759 --> 00:18:14.011
Mitsuura-san.

00:18:14.261 --> 00:18:17.806
I think I'm going to stop coming here.

00:18:18.056 --> 00:18:20.183
Kurosaki-san? But why?!

00:18:20.434 --> 00:18:22.978
If everything goes well with your research

00:18:23.228 --> 00:18:26.607
and you actually develop the technology
to make espers out of people,

00:18:26.857 --> 00:18:30.944
we might get more espers
who misuse their powers.

00:18:31.194 --> 00:18:33.780
So I think you should just stop.

00:18:34.031 --> 00:18:35.574
